WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:25.240 --> 00:01:26.870
The Buff Clan's Gije,

00:01:26.870 --> 00:01:29.980
attacked the Solo Ship using the Heavy Mobile Mecha Giran Dou.

00:01:37.380 --> 00:01:40.470
The combat in subspace, DS Fight,

00:01:40.470 --> 00:01:45.540
ended when Bes ordered the Solo Ship's DS Drive engines to stop.

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:49.740
They successfully escaped from Gije and Abadede's attack,

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:53.950
but faced an unknown planet...

00:01:57.130 --> 00:02:03.100
<b>Duel in the Sandstorm</b>

00:02:11.410 --> 00:02:13.060
Gram Zan located!

00:02:13.060 --> 00:02:16.150
Coordinates S.S. Arm Yosolo!

00:02:17.130 --> 00:02:18.380
Current speed nominal.

00:02:18.380 --> 00:02:20.490
Countdown 30.

00:02:24.090 --> 00:02:26.660
Were you able to contact Lady Harulu?

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:27.870
Yes.

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:33.270
Lady Harulu is preparing to head here leading a reinforcement squadron.

00:02:33.270 --> 00:02:34.490
That's good.

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:37.770
I have a request.

00:02:37.770 --> 00:02:38.590
What is it?

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:40.760
Without the Gataman Zan's Subspace Sensor,

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:42.760
and Sir Abadede's direction,

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:46.650
we wouldn't have been able to pursue the aliens' ship this far.

00:02:46.650 --> 00:02:50.600
After all this trouble, we cannot afford to let this chance go to waste.

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:53.520
I don't think there's a reason to be hasty.

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:59.280
If Lady Harulu arrives here, I have no choice but to acknowledge my failure.

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:02.280
My reputation as a samurai will diminish.

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:03.820
A samurai?

00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:08.540
I didn't think you still had the guts to call yourself one.

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:10.210
Damido...

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:13.620
Gije!

00:03:14.430 --> 00:03:17.210
I like that attitude of yours.

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:20.230
However, we need serve as a beacon for Harulu's squad.

00:03:20.230 --> 00:03:22.590
You have to act independently, is that alright?

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:23.460
Yes sir!

00:03:24.190 --> 00:03:25.840
Sir Abadede!

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:28.750
I'll lend you the Heavy Mobile Mecha Dogg Mack.

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:31.300
Damido, you'll back him up.

00:03:59.810 --> 00:04:01.560
Hey, let me do it!

00:04:01.560 --> 00:04:02.920
Don't touch it, you'll get burned!

00:04:02.920 --> 00:04:04.500
It looks fun!

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:06.300
Ah? Cosmo!

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:07.100
Cosmo!

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:07.640
You'll fall!

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:10.140
Cosmo, you never play with us, let's play!

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:11.330
Don't bother me, kids!

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:13.070
Go to the forest dome!

00:04:13.070 --> 00:04:15.150
Cosmo, aren't you a kid too?

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:16.910
Ashura!

00:04:16.910 --> 00:04:18.820
There's a fourth part to the Ideon?

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:20.600
Yeah, we found it inside the Solo Ship.

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:23.590
We should be able to fight for a while with this.

00:04:23.590 --> 00:04:24.740
Is that true, Techno?

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:25.360
Yeah.

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:27.640
These are parts for the Ideon. However...

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:31.530
We should quickly form a team for the purpose of reproducing the Ideon's metal.

00:04:31.530 --> 00:04:32.350
Please do so.

00:04:32.350 --> 00:04:34.370
We can control the Ideon somehow,

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:36.710
but that sort of thing is out of our league.

00:04:37.060 --> 00:04:38.880
I'm not so sure about the pilot either.

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:40.230
What have you done?

00:04:40.230 --> 00:04:41.860
I'm just doing my part.

00:04:41.860 --> 00:04:42.840
You!

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:45.760
Who gave you the permission to wander around the ship?

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:48.570
It's not like I was locked up, so I went out.

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:49.750
Guard!

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:55.740
Make sure this woman doesn't leave the forest behind the main bridge.

00:04:55.740 --> 00:04:57.010
Yes ma'am!

00:04:58.080 --> 00:04:59.500
Scary!

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:01.080
That's the enemy woman.

00:05:01.080 --> 00:05:02.070
You two!

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:03.150
Why are you here?!

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:06.560
This is no place for children!

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:08.610
Scary...

00:05:12.760 --> 00:05:13.850
Where's Fard?

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:15.530
He's not coming, like I thought.

00:05:16.310 --> 00:05:19.780
That Fard, how can he stay in such a boring place?

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:22.450
Let's go, let's go! On an adventure!

00:05:23.810 --> 00:05:26.960
Hey, Lou! There, be good!

00:05:28.900 --> 00:05:31.430
Lin, have you seen Deck and Ashura?

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:32.630
Well...

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:36.840
Where could they have gone?

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:40.000
They've got a lot of curiosity.

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:42.600
They must be wandering around inside the Solo Ship.

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:45.970
There, good boy.

00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:47.310
Curiosity?

00:05:53.970 --> 00:05:56.970
We're going to lose our way,

00:05:56.970 --> 00:05:59.140
shouldn't we go back before we get lost?

00:05:59.140 --> 00:06:03.960
Don't be such a wimp. We came here to explore!

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:08.120
But we shouldn't be doing this, right?

00:06:22.790 --> 00:06:23.990
Dinosaur...

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:25.350
A dinosaur!

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:27.150
It's a dinosaur!

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:32.240
It's leaving!

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:34.190
Stop! Stop it!

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:35.640
I'm going!

00:06:35.640 --> 00:06:37.820
Stop it, Ashura! Hey!
I'm going!

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:41.550
Damido's squadron will come assist when needed.

00:06:41.550 --> 00:06:43.120
Standby for launch!

00:06:43.120 --> 00:06:44.740
Open hatch 3!

00:06:45.650 --> 00:06:47.260
Dogg Mack, Launch!

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:50.500
Three, two, one, zero!

00:07:09.540 --> 00:07:11.690
I'm always looked down upon.

00:07:12.170 --> 00:07:15.690
It's like I'm here only to make Gije look better!

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:21.640
Deck! Ashura!

00:07:21.640 --> 00:07:23.060
What happened, Lotta?!

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:25.190
Did Deck and Ashura come here?

00:07:25.190 --> 00:07:26.040
I don't know.

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:28.190
Ms. Sheryl! Have you seen those two?

00:07:28.190 --> 00:07:29.210
Haven't seen them!

00:07:29.210 --> 00:07:30.800
They were here 30 minutes ago, though.

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:33.720
So, it's as Fard said!

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:35.720
I don't want to crawl down here anymore!

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:37.920
You've got a small body, don't complain!

00:07:38.990 --> 00:07:40.740
Lotta, what is it?

00:07:40.740 --> 00:07:43.560
It looks like Deck and Ashura went to explore!

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:44.500
Explore?

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:45.770
They left the Solo Ship?

00:07:45.950 --> 00:07:51.920
Yes, Fard told me that Deck wanted
to go out and explore this planet.

00:07:51.920 --> 00:07:53.490
Okay, I'll look for them.

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:54.420
Kasha!

00:07:54.420 --> 00:07:55.620
You called me?

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:56.990
Go help Cosmo!

00:07:56.990 --> 00:07:58.170
Huh?

00:07:58.170 --> 00:08:00.410
You can't use the Sol Amber!

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:01.510
What are you saying?!

00:08:01.510 --> 00:08:04.920
They probably left because you got so hysteric!

00:08:05.090 --> 00:08:06.530
Cosmo!

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:09.930
I'm already doing everything I can!

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:11.770
Cooking, laundry, cleaning, looking after the kids,

00:08:11.770 --> 00:08:15.590
herding the animals, growing vegetables, what more do you expect from me?!

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:16.760
I get it!

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:19.220
Bes! You're going too?

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:20.280
Can't I?

00:08:20.280 --> 00:08:24.340
The repairs are complete, we need to go on a test flight anyway.

00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:29.270
And most importantly, I happen to like those kids.

00:08:29.270 --> 00:08:34.190
A couple of kids can't be as important as the entire ship at a time like this.

00:08:52.270 --> 00:08:55.280
The controller still isn't fixed!

00:08:55.280 --> 00:08:56.500
Piece of junk!

00:08:57.820 --> 00:08:59.670
Good to see you coming, Kasha.

00:09:00.070 --> 00:09:02.810
This much better than being with Sheryl and Lotta!

00:09:03.240 --> 00:09:05.520
This isn't working, I'll return to the Solo Ship!

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:06.220
Roger!

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:16.740
That dinosaur must be returning to its nest. Do we have to go?

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:18.610
There might be some eggs there!

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:22.030
What's it doing?

00:09:23.090 --> 00:09:24.400
Ah! Look!

00:09:45.370 --> 00:09:47.680
Ah! It's a baby dinosaur!

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:48.990
That's dangerous!

00:09:48.990 --> 00:09:50.770
Come here! Hey!

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:51.600
Ashura!

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:57.440
Hey, Ashura, let's go!

00:09:57.440 --> 00:09:59.360
But it's so cute!

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:00.400
But...

00:10:02.970 --> 00:10:04.070
Ashura!

00:10:11.600 --> 00:10:12.560
It's coming!

00:10:12.560 --> 00:10:14.240
Deck!

00:10:30.410 --> 00:10:31.660
Get further away!

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:32.700
Watch out!

00:10:32.700 --> 00:10:34.680
You didn't have to come here!

00:10:35.420 --> 00:10:36.600
What's that?

00:10:39.090 --> 00:10:39.950
Deck!

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:41.410
I want you two to hide behind those rocks!

00:10:41.590 --> 00:10:43.160
Ah! Ashura!

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:56.960
It's a miracle this thing can stop in midair!

00:11:02.020 --> 00:11:03.390
They're gone...

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:04.880
What's going on?

00:11:08.490 --> 00:11:10.230
There's something over there...

00:11:13.960 --> 00:11:14.770
I knew it...

00:11:23.380 --> 00:11:24.900
Wh, what the...?!

00:11:36.140 --> 00:11:37.750
A Buff Clan machine?

00:11:48.490 --> 00:11:50.590
If you don't attack... Then I will!

00:12:16.350 --> 00:12:17.830
They caught us!

00:12:18.850 --> 00:12:20.540
Alright, I got them!

00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:24.380
Listen to me, aliens! You have forced us to take hostages!

00:12:26.320 --> 00:12:27.360
Damn it!

00:12:27.360 --> 00:12:29.330
Deck and Ashura got caught!

00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:31.970
For a samurai of the Buff Clan,

00:12:31.970 --> 00:12:35.300
a one-on-one duel is the most honored form of combat!

00:12:35.300 --> 00:12:36.720
Samurai?!

00:12:36.720 --> 00:12:38.370
If you too are a samurai,

00:12:38.370 --> 00:12:41.710
you'll accept my challenge and decide this once and for all!

00:12:41.710 --> 00:12:43.700
Decide this once and for all?

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:51.280
Hostages, huh...

00:12:51.280 --> 00:12:53.050
Gije, you better take caution.

00:12:53.050 --> 00:12:56.050
All units, stay on alert if the alien accepts the duel.

00:12:56.050 --> 00:12:57.030
Yes sir!

00:12:57.030 --> 00:12:59.690
That alien! It looks like he accepted!

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:04.290
We're falling!

00:13:25.730 --> 00:13:27.360
If I win the duel,

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:29.630
will you stop attacking the Solo Ship?

00:13:29.630 --> 00:13:31.200
No, I refuse.

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:33.730
It's not even worth arguing with a kid.

00:13:34.300 --> 00:13:36.810
On my planet, I'm a proper adult!

00:13:36.810 --> 00:13:37.870
Damn!

00:13:44.060 --> 00:13:45.760
Will you quit that, kid?!

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:47.430
Make me!

00:13:49.990 --> 00:13:53.690
You bastards attacked us just because we're aliens!

00:13:53.690 --> 00:13:56.800
Because of that, my parents were killed!

00:13:56.800 --> 00:13:58.840
Do you expect me to just do nothing?!

00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:01.390
Such a one-sided remark.

00:14:01.390 --> 00:14:03.940
We are the ones who have suffered the most.

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:05.130
Why do you oppose us?!

00:14:05.130 --> 00:14:06.370
What'd you say?

00:14:09.690 --> 00:14:12.570
If you bastards hadn't come, we wouldn't be fighting!

00:14:12.570 --> 00:14:13.720
Very well.

00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:18.160
Hand over the Giant and Lady Karala, then we'll retreat.

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:20.080
Tell that to the man you call Bes.

00:14:20.270 --> 00:14:21.580
Give me a break!

00:14:21.580 --> 00:14:23.660
As if we could do that!

00:14:29.610 --> 00:14:31.220
Cosmo is dueling with the enemy?!

00:14:31.740 --> 00:14:33.090
Dueling?

00:14:33.090 --> 00:14:34.260
What?

00:14:34.570 --> 00:14:36.770
Cosmo's in a duel with the Buff Clan!

00:14:36.950 --> 00:14:38.980
A duel? What's this about?

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:41.310
I don't know. Have Kasha launch!

00:14:41.310 --> 00:14:43.730
There's a fighter and a giant machine,

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:44.690
but it's all quiet.

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:49.440
Take that!

00:14:52.670 --> 00:14:54.660
Cosmo!

00:14:56.260 --> 00:14:58.010
Do you know what this is?

00:14:58.010 --> 00:14:59.500
It's a laser sword.

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:00.620
I know.

00:15:01.770 --> 00:15:03.580
If this is how a deathmatch goes,

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:06.150
and you can end it without suffering...

00:15:06.150 --> 00:15:08.170
You annoy me.

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:09.650
The battle is over.

00:15:09.650 --> 00:15:12.210
If you want me to spare you, I will.

00:15:14.130 --> 00:15:15.960
You're an ill-mannered kid.

00:15:16.530 --> 00:15:19.060
A samurai should always be righteous in his actions.

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:21.560
Leave from here.

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:22.390
What?!

00:15:22.390 --> 00:15:23.930
Someone's coming.

00:15:24.580 --> 00:15:25.510
It's Bes.

00:15:32.010 --> 00:15:34.370
This is a laser sword for dueling. Pick it up!

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:38.160
It seems the honor of a duel is exceedingly important to the Buff Clan.

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:39.060
That's right.

00:15:39.060 --> 00:15:40.300
What are your terms?

00:15:40.300 --> 00:15:44.290
If I win, you'll hand over that spaceship and the Giant.

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:47.440
We'll leave you enough resources to live on this planet.

00:15:47.440 --> 00:15:48.750
And if you lose?

00:15:48.750 --> 00:15:50.710
If I lose?

00:15:52.460 --> 00:15:54.540
I shall stop chasing you.

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:58.010
In any case, we want Lady Karala back.

00:15:58.510 --> 00:16:00.810
Leave her in the custody of that man, Damido.

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:04.020
That Gije...

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:08.360
Does he think those aliens can 
understand the way of the samurai?

00:16:08.360 --> 00:16:09.680
Understood.

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:24.400
That guy... Is he really gonna keep his promise?

00:16:32.730 --> 00:16:34.380
There's the third machine...

00:16:35.290 --> 00:16:37.700
Biras, order all units to head out!

00:16:37.700 --> 00:16:38.790
Huh?

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:40.510
The parts of the Giant...

00:16:41.160 --> 00:16:43.120
They're gathering here.

00:16:43.120 --> 00:16:45.100
This is our chance to attack the aliens' ship.

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:47.240
But what about Sir Gije's arrangement?

00:16:47.240 --> 00:16:48.790
Those are aliens!

00:16:48.790 --> 00:16:50.570
They won't be confined by a promise!

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:52.990
Yes, I suppose so.

00:16:55.170 --> 00:16:58.450
All units, attack the alien spaceship!

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:01.320
Don't forget to concentrate your fire on the engine!

00:17:04.180 --> 00:17:05.250
What?! They suddenly left!

00:17:05.430 --> 00:17:06.620
Damido!

00:17:11.100 --> 00:17:14.140
Will you fulfill your promise to have your forces withdraw?

00:17:14.140 --> 00:17:15.800
You consider this a victory?!

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:17.820
Aren't you a samurai?!

00:17:17.820 --> 00:17:19.610
A samurai doesn't go back on his word!

00:17:19.610 --> 00:17:22.260
Without an overseer, the battle isn't decided.

00:17:23.830 --> 00:17:27.520
Let Sir Gije go! If you don't, these kids...

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:29.820
You scum! That's not what you promised!

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:31.650
Is this something a samurai would do?

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:34.580
Narobu is my underling, not a samurai.

00:17:34.580 --> 00:17:36.540
Let Sir Gije go!

00:17:36.540 --> 00:17:38.230
It hurts!

00:17:38.230 --> 00:17:38.910
Go!

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:41.360
Damn aliens with their weird ways...

00:17:42.800 --> 00:17:44.450
What kind of samurai is that?!

00:17:50.940 --> 00:17:52.590
What is Damido doing?!

00:17:52.590 --> 00:17:53.830
I don't know.

00:17:54.560 --> 00:17:55.670
He just suddenly...

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:57.630
Just when it was going well!

00:17:57.630 --> 00:18:00.200
This is a perfect chance, we should attack.

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:02.400
Don't disgrace us any further!

00:18:02.400 --> 00:18:03.120
Huh?

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:06.450
I've been disgraced because of Damido!

00:18:06.450 --> 00:18:10.390
We'll wait until the aliens are prepared to fight!

00:18:12.730 --> 00:18:15.690
Why isn't the enemy attacking us?

00:18:15.690 --> 00:18:16.690
How should I know?

00:18:16.690 --> 00:18:20.020
He's got his pride, he's waiting for us to make a move.

00:18:20.020 --> 00:18:21.620
Why would an alien do that?

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:22.650
I don't know!

00:18:29.970 --> 00:18:32.880
Waiting for us on purpose, what kind of enemy is this?

00:18:50.490 --> 00:18:52.520
Aren't we going to dock, Cosmo?

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:54.520
Kasha! Bes! Can you get airborne?

00:18:56.530 --> 00:18:59.240
Okay, let's lift off and dock!

00:18:59.420 --> 00:19:00.450
Roger!

00:19:22.020 --> 00:19:23.550
Aim carefully!

00:19:36.420 --> 00:19:37.650
Use the anti-air cannons!

00:19:37.650 --> 00:19:38.900
You're too slow!

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:42.900
Just because of two kids, the Solo Ship is completely defenseless!

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:56.020
What? The Solo Ship?

00:19:56.020 --> 00:19:58.400
We need to end this fight fast!

00:19:58.400 --> 00:19:59.970
The Solo Ship's in danger?

00:20:02.570 --> 00:20:03.550
Running away?!

00:20:09.990 --> 00:20:11.430
I'll strike you down!

00:20:24.510 --> 00:20:25.660
They broke free!

00:20:45.190 --> 00:20:47.550
Damn alien Giant!

00:20:49.200 --> 00:20:50.760
He's over there!

00:20:50.760 --> 00:20:54.170
Bes, Cosmo! Let's trample that man!

00:20:56.770 --> 00:20:59.170
Cosmo! Aren't you going to do it?

00:21:01.230 --> 00:21:04.300
What are you two doing? Hey!

00:21:04.300 --> 00:21:05.740
I'll do it!

00:21:08.470 --> 00:21:09.970
Stop!

00:21:13.870 --> 00:21:15.420
He's a samurai.

00:21:15.420 --> 00:21:17.360
You can't just step on him!

00:21:17.360 --> 00:21:19.200
Let's go back and cover the Solo Ship!

00:21:19.600 --> 00:21:20.730
Are you serious?

00:21:20.730 --> 00:21:22.600
This is our chance to get even!

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:32.700
That Gije!

00:21:32.700 --> 00:21:34.890
He didn't beat that giant!

00:22:01.230 --> 00:22:02.130
Deck,

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:04.300
never go out on your own like that again.

00:22:04.300 --> 00:22:05.110
Yeah.

00:22:05.110 --> 00:22:07.250
Ashura. Don't do it again.

00:22:08.940 --> 00:22:10.380
Okay, let's go.

00:22:13.820 --> 00:22:15.130
It's alright.

00:22:15.570 --> 00:22:17.810
There's no need to cry.

00:22:18.540 --> 00:22:21.580
Bes, Cosmo! Answer me!

00:22:21.580 --> 00:22:24.470
Why did you let that man escape?!

00:22:24.470 --> 00:22:28.360
If we don't defeat them while we have the chance, they...

00:22:29.400 --> 00:22:31.880
Honor those who honor you...

00:22:31.880 --> 00:22:34.280
That's what it means to be a samurai.

00:22:50.650 --> 00:22:54.420
<i>Desperate to win, the Buff Clan devise a risky attack.</i>

00:22:54.770 --> 00:22:59.570
<i>Their plan is to lure the Solo Ship into subspace.</i>

00:23:00.150 --> 00:23:04.360
<i>In there, a battleship awaits!</i>

00:23:04.360 --> 00:23:10.420
<i>Even though the Ideon isn't working on full power, Cosmo must take part in the risky battle!</i>

00:23:10.420 --> 00:23:15.020
<i>Next time, on Legendary Giant Ideon: "Burning Subspace"</i>

00:23:12.610 --> 00:23:17.580
<b>Next Episode</b>

